<title>USA: Hauser Inc FY97 April 30 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Hauser Inc FY97 April 30 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BOULDER, Colo. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal Year		 Fiscal Year</p>
<p>					  Ended			Ended</p>
<p>				  Apr 30, 1997	     Apr 30, 1996</p>
<p> TOTAL REVENUES		$25,225,766		$17,439,432</p>
<p> LOSS FROM OPERATIONS	(6,041,396)	     (10,582,052)</p>
<p>LOSS FROM CONTINUING</p>
<p>   OPERATIONS		  (3,902,926)		(6,440,244)</p>
<p>LOSS FROM DISCONTINUED</p>
<p>   OPERATIONS		  (2,628,610)		(1,296,092)</p>
<p> NET LOSS			(6,531,536)		(7,736,336)</p>
<p>LOSS PER SHARE-CONTINUING</p>
<p>   OPERATIONS			 (0.38)		     (0.62)</p>
<p>LOSS PER SHARE-DISCONTINUED</p>
<p>   OPERATIONS			 (0.25)		     (0.13)</p>
<p> NET LOSS PER SHARE		 (0.63)		     (0.75)</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE SHARES</p>
<p>   OUTSTANDING		  10,389,111		 10,344,169</p>
<p>NOTE:  The fiscal 1997 loss from discontinued operations reflects the sale of Hauser's subsidiary, Ironwood Evergreens in October 1996.</p>
